  "commentary": {
    "bulkers": "Minerva Marine have committed their Newcastlemax \"Sikamia\" 207/2008 Universal, Japan (SS 08/2028, DD 08/2026, Scrubber fitted) to Chinese interests at USD 29 mill. For comparison, the two-years-younger sister vessel \"Amber Horizon\" 207/2010 Universal, Japan (SS 03/2028, DD 03/2026) was sold in November at USD 33 mill. The Kamsarmax \"Bettys Dream\" 82/2008 Tsuneishi, Japan (SS/DD 12/2025, BWTS fitted) of Zihni Shipping & Trading was committed to Chinese interests at USD 12,8 mill. Note that back in September, the one-year-younger sister vessel \"Lily Atlantic\" 82/2009 Tsuneishi, Japan (SS 10/2029, DD 08/2027, BWTS fitted) was sold at USD 16,3 mill. In addition, the \"Ru Meng Ling\" 81/2010 Universal, Japan (SS/DD 04/2025, BWTS fitted) was committed to Greek interests at USD 15,4 mill. Tokai Shipping have committed their Handysize \"Momo Glory\" 28/2014 I-S, Japan (SS 01/2029, DD 01/2027, BWTS fitted) to Greek interests at USD 12 mill. Remind you that back in September, the one-year-younger sister vessel \"Globe Explorer\" 28/2015 I-S, Japan (SS/DD 02/2025, BWTS fitted) was sold at USD 14,2 mill.",
    "tankers": "The MR2 \"Kyra\" 47/2006 Iwagi, Japan (SS/DD 01/2026, BWTS fitted) was committed to undisclosed interests at USD 17,1 mill, while the one-year- younger \"Chiba\" 45/2007 Shin Kurushima, Japan (SS 01/2027, DD 04/2025, BWTS fitted) of SR Navigation was committed at USD 17 mill. For reference, the \"Fos Power\" 47/2007 Onomichi, Japan (SS 04/2027, DD 12/2025, BWTS fitted) was sold back in September at USD 24 mill.",
    "freight": {}
  },
